        "Chiu Lō͘-sòaⁿ 118 (Eng-bûn: ; SR-118) sī chi̍t tiâu tī Bí-kok Alabama Chiu ê chiu-kip kong-lō͘.",
        "Chiu Chú-kàn Kong-lō͘ 79 (Eng-bûn: ; WIS 79; STH 79), mā tiāⁿ-tiāⁿ hō-chòe Kong-lō͘ 79 (), sī chi̍t tiâu tī Bí-kok Wisconsin Chiu ê chiu-kip kong-lō͘.",
        "Illinois Lō͘-sòaⁿ 159 (Eng-bûn: ; IL 159) sī chi̍t tiâu ūi-tī Bí-kok Illinois Chiu ê chiu-kip kong-lō͘.",
        "1996 nî 5 goe̍h 15 hō, Birdy tī Eng-kok Hampshire ê Lymington chhut-sì. I-ê lāu-pē sī Rupert Oliver Benjamin van den Bogaerde; lāu-bú sī Hon. Sophie Patricia (née Roper-Curzon) sī chi̍t ūi kǹg-khîm-ka. Birdy chū 7 hòe khai-sí o̍h tôaⁿ kǹg-khîm; tī 8 hòe ê sî-chūn chiū khai-sí chhòng-chok ka-kī ê im-ga̍k. In pē-bú tī 1995 nî kiat-hun, tû-liáu Birdy, iáu-ū lēng-gōa 2 ūi kiáⁿ-jî: Jake (1997 nî chhut-sì) kap Caitlin (1999 nî chhut-sì). Āu-lâi, Birdy chiân-óng Brockenhurst ê Brockenhurst Ha̍k-īⁿ chiū-tho̍k; he sī tī New Forest ê chi̍t keng ū-kho ha̍k-hāu.",
        "5 goe̍h 19 ji̍t: Malcolm X, Bí-kok chèng-tī-chiá.",
        "10 goe̍h 9 ji̍t: John Lennon, chhòng-chok koa-chhiú.",
        "12 goe̍h 19 ji̍t: Chîⁿ Chiong-su, Tiong-kok chok-ka. 1910 nî chhut-sì.",
        "Jacques Chirac, Hoat-kok Chóng-thóng (1995 nî – 2007 nî)",
