        "Étercy sī ūi-tī Hoat-kok Rhône-Alpes toā-khu Haute-Savoie koān ê chi̍t ê commune.",
        "Tī Compans ê sì-ûi ū Saint-Mesmes, Thieux, Gressy, Messy, kap Mitry-Mory téng siâⁿ-chhī he̍k-chiá chng-siā.",
